WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.640
In the spreading darkness, we fought each other, we cut each other's throats

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:11.150
It's fine if you don't want me to get in the way of anyone

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:36.040
You will continue to kill criminals whose names are broadcast.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:40.000
Outside of that, you're free to use the Death Note however you wish.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:41.770
That's the only condition.

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:47.290
If everything happens as Light Yagami planned, this should help save Misa.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.730
Do as I say and you'll get what you want.

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:53.250
In the end, it works out well for both of us.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:56.790
I suppose for someone in your position, you'd call this good business.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.940
Mr. Yagami, are you alright? There's no reason for you to keep doing this to yourself.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:13.250
It's been over a month since Kira started killing criminals again.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:19.000
And as far as I'm concerned, that's all the proof I need to be sure that my son isn't Kira.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.360
So then, all that's left is for you to be sure.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.380
One way or another, when I get out of here, it will be with my son.

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:29.970
Wow, the ch-

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.060
Chief can be pretty stubborn.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.220
Light, how are you feeling right now?

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.530
I'm okay.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:42.120
Ryusaki, I know that in the time I've been in prison, no new criminals have died.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:48.000
However, that suggests to me that Kira must be someone who's intimately familiar with my situation.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.280
No, Light.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:52.740
The reason criminals have stopped dying is because you are Kira.

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.520
No, I'm not Kira.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.440
How many times do I have to say it?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.980
