00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:05.560
This is just cruel.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.340
I don't care if he is a suspect.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.280
Light still has a right to know that criminals are being killed again.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.240
It's supposed to be funny.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:23.440
How are you expecting me to look after being tied up and questioned for this many days?

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:26.950
Please just let me go.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.900
I want to see Light.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.510
Please, Light, let me...

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.820
