00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.480
We know that much already, so what are you waiting for?

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.040
Not true.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:58.960
All we really know at this point is that Amani harbors an unnaturally strong devotion for Light Yagami.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:08.170
