00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:36.830
I see. If he was able to kill under these circumstances, then he wouldn't have been concerned about those FBI agents in the first place.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.480
It's already been 50 days. There's no point to this anymore.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:46.020
Ryozaki, it's time to start looking for the real Kira.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.180
Yes, I understand.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:07.520
Mr. Yagami.

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:09.460
Yes, what is it?

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.400
Would you be willing to come to headquarters just once?

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.860
