00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.710
What? I remember now.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.570
You told me I was being arrested for being the second kid.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.980
You mean that was for real?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.000
