00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.560
Where is it? Here it is.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.240
23 floors above ground, and two below.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:38.890
Although it's impossible to see it from the outside,

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:41.350
there are two helicopters hidden on the roof.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:42.980
What? It's amazing.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:47.030
Ideally, I want all of us to spend as much time here as possible.

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:50.430
If the investigation team grows, we can accommodate up to 60 people.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:54.380
Misa shouldn't have any complaints, since she'll have her own floor.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:59.240
This is truly impressive to go to such lengths.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:18:59.980
Hold on a second.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.640
Where did you find the finances to build this thing?

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:07.340
As you can see, it is my intention to solve this case no matter what it takes.

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.280
I'm sorry, but how is that an answer?

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:12.160
No, he's right.

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:14.720
The mass killings are bad enough already,

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:18.860
but personally, I will never forgive Kitta for putting my dad and I through this.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:21.890
I want to solve this no matter what it takes.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:26.390
If you're serious about that, you should try to get close to Misa and find out about the second...

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.370
I can't. That goes against my principles.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:29.870
Right, you said that.

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:36.530
Uh, nothing. I'm just feeling really motivated right now, Chief.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:41.620
Ryuzaki, Chief Yagami, Light, let's get out of here and bring Kira to justice.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:45.760
Excuse me, I couldn't help but notice you missed my name.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.980
This looks like all of us. Let's get started.

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:05.660
We're all here to further the growth of the Yotsuba group by reducing competition.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:09.270
So the question is, who is going to die?

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:13.340
I'm not thrilled that we have to do this every single week.

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:20.110
This may be irrelevant, but I have to wonder what prompted Kira to start killing business people in addition to the usual criminals and such.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:23.310
Come on now, haven't you figured this out yet, Takahashi?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:28.040
This is the most advantageous course of action for Kira.

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:29.520
Advantageous?

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.280
He's basically started a killing service, Higuchi.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:35.400
You have a lot to say considering how stupid you are.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.020
I'd hate to see you get killed because of it.

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:43.770
Despite the fact that we're all relatively young, all of us are now frontrunners to become

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:45.250
Yotsuba's next CEO.

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:50.880
Not to mention, our salaries have virtually eclipsed those of the other employees in the

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.300
company.

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:57.350
It's unlikely he would choose to back a particular company, no matter how you look

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:57.670
at it.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.720
One of the people in this room.

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:01.100
Has to be Kira.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:08.880
So, back to business.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:10.420
Does anyone have a proposal?

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.760
Who should we have Kira eliminate this week, gentlemen?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.820
Human beings are truly disgusting creatures.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:35.690
Thank you for watching!

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:43.980
It's no good. It's obvious from the way you talk that he won't be satisfied until I'm convicted as kidder.

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:46.220
Stop this, Ryuzaki!
